  "instructions": [
    "Heat the coconut oil in a pan over low heat.",
    "Mince the garlic and saut\u00069 in the oil until fragrant.",
    "Add the lemongrass, chili peppers, and kaffir lime leaves to the pan and saut\u00069 for 1 minute.",
    "Add the nuka-pickle to the pan and stir for 2 minutes.",
    "Add the tomatoes to the pan and stir for 3 minutes.",
    "Add 1 cup of water to the pan and bring to a simmer.",
    "Reduce heat to low and let the curry simmer for 20 minutes.",
    "Season with coriander powder and salt to taste.",
    "Serve hot over rice or noodles."
